# Project Intelligence

- **Shell:** Working directory commands run under PowerShell 7 — `dir`/`ls` are aliases; use `Get-ChildItem` or `php artisan` for listing.
- **PowerShell quoting:** `$var` expands in double quotes — pass PHP/CLI code in single-quoted strings or temp files to avoid parse errors.
- **This is the new-generation "Laravel" PHP framework v13** — NOT Laravel 12 and earlier. Schema uses `Schema::create('name', function (Blueprint $table) {...})` closures; migrations are anonymous classes (`return new class extends Migration`).
- **MySQL root account has no password** in this Laragon environment; DB name is `e-fasiliti`.
- **Default generated migrations already include a `sessions` table** (inside `create_users_table` migration) — database session driver is expected; just run `php artisan migrate`.
- **User language:** Malay/Indonesian — respond in that language when interacting.